<title>PHILIPPINES: Jollibee says 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Jollibee says 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>				    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>				     1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Net profit		     603		   537</p>
<p>    Revenues		     6,610		 4,920</p>
<p>    Sales			  8,280		 6,600</p>
<p>    Total assets		 4,470		 2,650</p>
<p>Note: Jollibee Foods Corp runs the biggest fast-food chain in the Philippines.</p>
</text>
